{"t":120.3,"text":"This is the agentic developer loop. understand the source, collect evidence from the real environment, and use that evidence to explain and fix the problem."}
{"t":131.7,"text":"Snapshot debugging. We already know snapshot debugging as a tool available to developers in Visual Studio Code. The agentic workflow follows the same principles,"}
